    "se": "0450",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ダンストレーナー",
    "text": "──ふふっ、凛世ちゃん\r\n『あ』がないなんて、やっぱりヘンな感じー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012003020030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "──そ、その……申し訳ございません……\r\nやはり……──",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200302/1012003020030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0450",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ダンストレーナー",
    "text": "あ、ううん！　いいの！\r\n私とのレッスンの時はぜひそうしてー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ダンストレーナー",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんからも言われてるんだー！\r\n『あ』抜きのセリフに慣れとかなきゃ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0220"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0451",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ダンストレーナー",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんとは『あ』だけの練習で、\r\n私とは、『あ』のない練習──でしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
